Third-party components
----------------------

hyprbars/hyprbars-bvos.patch
  Patches to the hyprbars plugin from https://github.com/hyprwm/hyprland-plugins
  (per-button alignment, button tooltips, and ending drags released over panels).
  hyprland-plugins is Copyright (c) 2023, Hypr Development, licensed under the
  BSD 3-Clause License (see hyprbars/LICENSE.hyprland-plugins). The patch is
  distributed under that same license. The plugin source itself is downloaded
  from upstream at install time.

Fonts (downloaded at install time, not included): Geist, Manrope and Inter,
  from Google Fonts, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The Windows package
  bundles Geist, Manrope and Weather Icons (c) Erik Flowers, all under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.

omarchy/plugins/bvos.screensaver/SGP4.js
  satellite.js v5.0.0, Copyright (C) 2013 Shashwat Kandadai and UCSC Jack Baskin
  School of Engineering, MIT License (see LICENSE.satellite-js next to it).

omarchy/plugins/bvos.screensaver/stars.json
  Derived from the Yale Bright Star Catalogue, 5th Revised Edition
  (Hoffleit & Warren, 1991; NASA/CDS catalog V/50), public domain.

omarchy/plugins/bvos.screensaver/constellations.json
  Constellation lines from d3-celestial, Copyright (c) 2015 Olaf Frohn,
  BSD 3-Clause License (see LICENSE.d3-celestial next to it).

Satellite orbital elements (fetched at runtime): CelesTrak (https://celestrak.org).

Weather data (fetched at runtime): wttr.in and Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com,
  CC BY 4.0 data). The Windows package finds its location with GeoJS
  (https://www.geojs.io) unless a place is set.
